<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">WALOMA</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA WALOMA</para>
  <para style="toc2">WALOMA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WALOMA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Ilongigwa kamba kitabu cha Waloma chandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo hagatigati ya kipigiti cha milao ya 54 na 58 songela kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisto. Paulo hatembelele bule wambo da Loma, avo kautuma usenga uno wa ndagizi ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wa idiwambo da Loma, awo wali Wayahudi na awo hawali Wayahudi. Kandika lupwilili luno kulawa mdiwambo da Kolinto ako kuyakalile yokala mkipigiti kija. Paulo kandika giladi kamba wanhu wa isi zose wamtamanile na kumtogola Yesu Kilisto (16:26).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Waloma kicho kitabu kilondigwa ng'hani na wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kila hanhu na kila kipigiti kwavija Paulo kaulongelela goya ukombola bila kifiso kamba tweye todaha kuupata kubitila Yesu Kilisto. Vivija Paulo kaulumba hamoja Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto na Lagano da Umwaka. Wasomi bwando wakiibamilila wolonga kamba mnhongo uli na mbweto muna ikitabu kino cha Waloma uwo 1:16 awo ulonga, “Siwonela kinyala Usenga Unogile, kwavija uwo mhiko ya Mulungu iwakombola wanhu wose woutogola, tanhu ha Wayahudi, na vivija ha Wamhazi.” Hanhu ha mwanduso mgati ya ikitabu cha Waloma (1—11) holongelela mbuli za gaja gamnogele Mulungu na gaja hagamnogele Mulungu, na hanhu ha ikabili (12—15) holongelela ndagizi bwando za kusang'hana sama ya ugima wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo kosonga lupwilili lwake kamba viyatendaga mkuitambula mwenyego na kulonga wanhu walihi yowaandikila (<char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho, kandika mbuli za kiunhu na ukombola udahika kubitila Yesu Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:16-11:36">1:16—11:36</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Vigamalile gano, Paulo kalava ndagizi bwando za kusang'hana sama ya ugima wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1—15:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho, kamambukiza ikitabu cha Waloma mkulava ndamsa bwando ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wa diwambo da Loma (<char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 16">16</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, mtumigwa wa Yesu Kilisto, yasaguligwe na Mulungu kuwa mtumigwa wa Kilisto na kutumigwa yakaupete Usenga Unogile wa Mulungu, <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>uyekile kilagano umwaka kubitila wahokozi zake Mzinyandiko Zing'alile. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Usenga uja umulonga Mwanage, Yesu Kilisto, ayo mmbuli ya kiunhu yakalile yolawa mulukolo lwa Daudi, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>na vija viyali na ung'azi ulawa ha Mulungu kalagusigwa na mhiko ng'hulu kuwa Mwana wa Mulungu kipigiti viyazusigwe kulawa mkudanganhika. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Kubitila heyo, Mulungu kanigwelela ngekewa na utumigwa wa Kilisto giladi niwapetele wanhu wa isi zose giladi watogole na kumtogola heyo, giladi twaga jake diyenzigwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Vivija na mweye mwa mmwanza wa waja wakemigwe kuwa wanhu wa Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Nowandikila mweye wanhu wose wa wambo da Loma, mnogelwe na Mulungu na mkemigwe kuwa wanhu zake mwenyego.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Ngekewa na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata wetu na kulawa ha Mndewa Yesu Kilisto viwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhambiko ya Kulava Hewela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Tanhu, nomuheweza Mulungu wangu kubitila Yesu Kilisto sama yenu mweye mose, kwavija nhamanila yenu yopetigwa muulumwengu wose. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Mulungu, inimsang'hanikila na moyo wangu wose mkuupeta Usenga Unogile wa Mwanage, iyo msindila wangu vija viniwakumbukila mweye mazua gose <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>muna zinhambiko zangu. Kipigiti chose notambika ha Mulungu, vihamnogela, yanidahize kwiza kumwenu sambisambi. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Kwavija nosulukila ng'hani niwone, giladi niwagwelele nhunza ya muloho giladi mgangamizwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Nie nolonda tuigangamize, nhamanila yenu inigangamize nie, na nhamanila yangu iwagangamize mweye.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonda m'vitange kamba mianza bwando nilonda kwiza kumwenu, ila nizuiligwa. Nilonda mmwanza wenu niwatende wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, kamba viniwatendile mmwanza wa Wamhazi wayagwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Kwavija nolondigwa kuwasang'hanikila wanhu wose, Wagiliki na wanhu hawali Wagiliki, wanhu wali na nzewele na walibule nzewele. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Avo, vivija nolonda kuupeta Usenga Unogile kumwenu mweye mkala hiko Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mhiko ya Usenga Unogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Siwonela kinyala Usenga Unogile, kwavija uwo mhiko ya Mulungu iwakombola wanhu wose woutogola, tanhu ha Wayahudi, na vivija ha Wamhazi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Kwavija Usenga Unogile wogubula vija Mulungu viyowatenda wanhu kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kubitila nhamanila songela haichanduso mbaka hakimambukizo, kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Munhu ayo yalibule uzenzeleganye kokala muinhamanila.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">HABAKUKI 2:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuhonyela Kiunhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Lusango lwa Mulungu lugubuligwa kulawa kuulanga ha wanhu walekile kumtanga Mulungu na ha wanhu wehile, awo woigubika ikweli na wiho wao. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Kwavija gaja godahika kutangigwa muna zimbuli za Mulungu wafunuliligwa, kwavija Mulungu kagalagusa kumwao. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Songela vuulumbigwe ulumwengu, mbuli za Mulungu ziifisile, nhegulo yake mhiko zake za digunge na uungu wake, zigubuligwa, zimanyika kulawa m'vinhu viyavilumbile. Avo wanhu wabule mbuli ya kuigombela. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Womtanga Mulungu, ila hawamuhishimila kamba Mulungu ama kumgwelela hewela, ila ngelegeza zao zigaluka ubozi, na nzonzi zao za ubozi zigeligwa kiziza. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Wokiiyona wabala, ila wabule nzewele, <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>na waleka kumtambikila Mulungu yokala digunge na kusonga kuitambikila miwegu ilingile kamba munhu ama ndege ama wang'onyo wali na magulu mane ama nyoka.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Avo Mulungu kawaleka wawinze mbuli zihile zisulukilwa na mioyo yao na kuitendela wenyego kwa wenyego mbuli za kinyala mzing'huli zao. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Waigalula ikweli ya Mulungu kuwa uvwizi, wavitambikila na kuvisang'hanikila vinhu vilumbigwe na Mulungu, na kuleka kumtambikila Mulungu yavilumbile, yolondigwa kuyenzigwa mazua gose! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Sama ya kilamso kino, Mulungu kawaleka wawinze sulukila zao zigela kinyala. Hata watwanzi zao wazihindula nzila za kuilumba zilumbigwe na Mulungu na kuilumba vija Mulungu havilumbile. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Vivija wambigalo na hewo waleka kuilumba na watwanzi na kuisulukila wenyego kwa wenyego. Wambigalo watenda mbuli zigela kinyala na wambigalo wayao na kubokela nhaguso ilumbile na gaja gawatendile.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Kwavija wanhu walema kumtanga Mulungu, Mulungu kawaleka mzinzonzi zao zihile, giladi watende mbuli hazilondigwe kutendigwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Wamema mbuli zose zihile, wiho, sulukila ya vinhu va wanhu, na kunogelwa na gehile. Wamema migongo, ukomaji, ngomba, uvwizi, na kuilondela gehile. Wodeta, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>wowalonga wanhu vihile, womwihila Mulungu, wamema maligo, magoda, na matopa. Wamema mbuli zihile na hawawahishimila waja wawalelile. <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>Wabozi, vizenzeleganye, wabule noge, na wabule bazi. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Wovitanga kamba lagizo da Mulungu dolonga kamba wanhu wotenda mbuli kamba zino wolondigwa wadanganhike. Hata avo, si kamba wazitenda mbuli hizo tu, ila hata kuwatogola wanhu wayagwe wozitenda mbuli hizo.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhaguso ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Avo haduhu kuigombela hata uhawile munhu yalihi ihawa komtagusa uvwizi miyago, kwavija vuubitiza nhaguso ha miyago, kokiitagusa mwenyego, kwavija na gweye kotenda gagaja gayatendile heyo. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Tovitanga kamba nhaguso ya Mulungu mwa awo wotenda vinhu kamba avo ikala muikweli. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Ila gweye, munhu, uwatagusa waja wotenda mbuli kamba zino ihawa na gweye mwenyego kotenda mbuli zizo, kogelegeza kodaha kuikimbila nhaguso ya Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Ama kodizabuza bwando da ugoli wa unozi wake na mwazaganyo wake? Huvimanya kamba unozi wa Mulungu wokulongoza gweye uleke vilozo? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Ila sama ya udala wa moyo wako na vija vuuli na moyo wa kulema kuleka vilozo, kokiimemekezela lusango gwegwe mwenyego kuna dizua da lusango aho nhaguso ya Mulungu ilibule uzenzeleganye vondaigubuligwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Kwavija Mulungu komuliha kila munhu kamba vija viyasang'hanike.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">ZABULI 62:12</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 24:12">LONZI 24:12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Awo wokwazaganya mkutenda ganogile wozahila yenzi, hishima, na ugima, Mulungu kowagwelela ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Wanhu wayagwe wozahila mbuli zao wenyego na awo woilema ikweli na kuzikweleleza mbuli zihile, Mulungu kowonela lusango na ng'hasilika. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Kuja kowa na mgayo na kugazika ha wanhu wose wotenda gehile, tanhu Wayahudi, abaho Wamhazi. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Ila Mulungu kowagwaa yenzi na hishima na tindiwalo wanhu wose wotenda ganogile, tanhu Wayahudi, abaho Wamhazi. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Kwavija Mulungu hasagula wa kumnogela.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Wanhu wose walozile bila kugatanga Malagizo ga Musa wokwangama hata kamba hawagatangile Gamalagizo, na wose walozile mkugatanga Malagizo wotagusigwa na Gamalagizo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Kwavija si kamba awo wogahulika Malagizo wawo walibule uzenzeleganye hameso ga Mulungu, ila waja wagagogile Malagizo wawo wapetigwe kamba wabule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Hata Wamhazi, awo walibule Malagizo ga Musa, yokoneka kamba wagatanga Malagizo ahaja vowagawinza bila kufundizwa na munhu, hata kamba hawanagahulika. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Yolagusa kamba gaja golondigwa na Malagizo gandikwa mmioyo yao, na udaho wao wa kusambula gehile na ganogile vivija wolava usindila, na ngelegeza zao kipigiti kiyagwe zowatagusa na kipigiti kiyagwe zowakikiwiza. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Mbuli zino zolawilila mdizua dija Mulungu vondayazitaguse ngelegeza zifisike za wanhu kubitila Yesu Kilisto kamba Usenga wangu Unogile vuulonga.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wayahudi na Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Gweye ukiikema mwenyego Muyahudi, na kogatamanila Malagizo ga Musa na kuigodela uhamoja na Mulungu, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>kamba vija kugatanga gaja goyolonda, na kugatogola gaja ganogile, kwavija kulagizigwa na Gamalagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>Kokwagiza kamba gweye kwa kilangizi wa vimbugumbugu, mulangaza mwa awo wali mdiziza, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>mkulufunzi wa wabozi, na mfundiza wana. Kokwagiza kamba kunago Malagizo gali na ilimu na kweli. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Gweye uwafundiza wanhu wayagwe, habali hukiifundiza gweye mwenyego? Gweye uwapetela wanhu sambiwebe, habali gweye kokwiba? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Gweye ulonga kamba wanhu sambiwatende ugoni, habali gweye kotenda ugoni? Gweye uihila miwegu, habali gweye kokwiba kulawa mzing'anda zao? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Gweye ukiitopela Malagizo ga Musa, habali gweye komzabuza Mulungu mkugakeng'enha Malagizo? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Twaga da Mulungu dofukuligwa hagatigati ya Wamhazi sama yenu mweye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">ISAYA 52:5</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 36:22">EZEKIELI 36:22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Kwingila kumbi kololwa kamba muhagagoga Malagizo ga Musa, ila kamba muhagakeng'enha Gamalagizo ga Musa, kwingila kumbi kumwenu kogaluka kuleka kwingila kumbi kamba Wamhazi. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Kamba awo walekile kwingila kumbi wahagagoga Malagizo ga Musa, kuleka kwingila kumbi hakupetigwa kamba kwingila kumbi kamba viwali wanhu wa Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Awo walekile kwingila kumbi da lukuli ila wogagoga Malagizo ga Musa wokutagusa gweye hata kamba kunago Gamalagizo gandikigwe na kwingila kumbi, kwavija kogakeng'enha Gamalagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Munhu hapetigwa kuwa Muyahudi mkuvumbuka ama mkwingila kumbi kwiyeka. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Munhu kowa Muyahudi wa kweli kamba yahawa Muyahudi kulawa mgati, ihawa moyo wake wingizigwa kumbi, na sang'hano ino yotendigwa na Loho wa Mulungu, na sio na Malagizo gandikigwe. Munhu kamba ino kobokela nhogolwa kulawa ha Mulungu, na sio kulawa ha wanhu.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Muyahudi kana kinhu chaki kibanzile? Ama kuna kinhu chaki cha kuigodela mwa munhu yengizigwe kumbi? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Kuna vinhu bwando va kuigodela! Tanhu, Mulungu kawagwelela Wayahudi usenga wake. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Yowaze kamba wayagwe mmwanza wao wabule nhamanila? Kuwa bule nhamanila kuwali nako komtenda Mulungu yawe kizenzeleganye? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Bule! Hata kamba kila munhu yahawa m'vwizi, Mulungu havwiza. Kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Giladi upetigwe kamba kwabule uzenzeleganye mzimbuli zako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">na kuhuma muinhaguso yako.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 51:4">ZABULI 51:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Kamba mbuli zetu zihile zosimulila lumosilumosi vija Mulungu viyalibule uzenzeleganye, tulongeze? Tulonge Mulungu kotenda vihile voyotugalila tweye lusango lwake? Hano nolonga kiunhu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Bule! Ihawile hivo, Mulungu yahadahile vilihi kuutagusa ulumwengu?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Ila ihawa uvwizi wangu woisang'hanikila yenzi ya Mulungu mkuitenda ikweli yake itangigwe ng'hani, habali ning'hali nidukumizwa kamba mtenda vilozo? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Habali hatulonga, kamba wanhu wayagwe vowotulonga vihile mkutulonga kamba tweye tulonga, “Leka tutende gehile giladi geze ganogile”? Walumba kutagusigwa.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Haduhu Munhu Yalibule Uzenzeleganye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Avo tulongeze? Tweye Wayahudi tunoga kubanza wanhu wayagwe? Bule! Kwavija tweye tose twisha kutagusigwa, wose, Wayahudi na Wamhazi twa hasi ya mhiko za vilozo. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Haduhu munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye, haduhu hata munhu imwe,<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>haduhu munhu yomtanga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">haduhu munhu yomzahila Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Wose wamuleka Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">wose hamoja wagaluka miwewela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">haduhu munhu yotenda ganogile, haduhu hata munhu imwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">ZABULI 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53:1-3</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="ECC 7:20">MSIMULIZI 7:20</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Mikolomelo yao ya kamba panga digubuligwe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mikolomelo yao ya kamba panga digubuligwe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wao wanhu wolonga mbuli zihile ng'hani zigala ifa.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">ndimi zao zolonga uvwizi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 5:9">ZABULI 5:9</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">sumu ya nyoka ya mmilomo yao.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 140:3">ZABULI 140:3</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>Milomo yao imema ndukumiza na usungu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">ZABULI 10:7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Magulu gao gowalongoza walopole kwita mulopa,<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>ubananzi na migayo va mzinzila zao,<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>na nzila ya tindiwalo hawaitanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">ISAYA 59:7-8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>Haduhu bwembwe da Mulungu haulongozi wa meso gao.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 36:1">ZABULI 36:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Sambi tovitanga kamba Malagizo ga Musa gowalonga waja wali hasi ya Gamalagizo higo, giladi munhu yoyose sambiyawe na mbuli ya kuigombela, na ulumwengu wose ulamulwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Kwavija haduhu munhu yondayapetigwe kamba kabule uzenzeleganye hameso gake mkugagoga Malagizo, kwavija kubitila Malagizo higo topata udaho wa kuvitanga vilozo tu.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vija Mulungu Viyotutenda Tuwe Bule Uzenzeleganye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Ila sambi nzila ya Mulungu ya kuwatenda wanhu wawe bule uzenzeleganye igubuligwa bila kutamanila Malagizo ga Musa, hata kamba Malagizo ga Musa na Nyandiko Zing'alile za wahokozi woilavila usindila. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kokwiza kubitila kumtamanila Yesu Kilisto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kubitila kumtamanila Yesu Kilisto </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yodaha kutapitigwa kamba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kubitila wende wa Yesu Kilisto.</char></note> mwa awo wose wotogola. Haduhu yam'banzile miyage, <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>kwavija wose watenda vilozo na kuhungukilwa na yenzi ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Wapetigwa kuwa wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye bila kuliha kinhu chochose, kubitila ukombola kulawa ha Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Mulungu kamulava Yesu yawe kamba nhosa ya kuwalumba wanhu na heyo mwenyego kubitila nhamanila mmulopa wake. Kagatenda gano kulagusa kamba kabule uzenzeleganye, kwavija mkwazaganya kumwake Mulungu hawataguse awo watendile vilozo umwaka. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Kagatenda gano giladi yalaguse kamba kabule uzenzeleganye mkipigiti kino na kamba voyomtenda munhu yoyose yomtamanila Yesu yawe bule uzenzeleganye.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Avo, choni chondatuigodele? Hahudu! Tuigode kwavija tugagoga Malagizo ga Musa? Si vivo, ila kwavija tutogola kamba Yesu kotukombola. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Kwavija tuvimanya kamba munhu kopetigwa kamba kabule uzenzeleganye kubitila nhamanila na sio mkugagoga Gamalagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Ama Mulungu ka Mulungu wa Wayahudi weiyeka? Heyo vivija hali Mulungu wa Wamhazi? Ona, heyo vivija ka Mulungu wa Wamhazi. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Mulungu ka imwe, yowatenda wawe bule uzenzeleganye waja wengile kumbi kubitila nhamanila na waja walekile kwingila kumbi kubitila nhamanila iija. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Avo, tugase Gamalagizo ga Musa sama ya nhamanila ino? Si vivo, ila togavikiza Gamalagizo ga Musa.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kamba Vija Viyatendile Ablaham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Tulonge choni mmbuli zija ziyapatile Ablaham, muhenga wetu mmbuli ya kiunhu? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Kamba Ablaham koneka kabule uzenzeleganye hameso ga Mulungu kubitila sang'hano zake za lukuli, avo kana kinhu cha kuigodela, ila sio haulongozi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Nyandiko Zing'alile zolongaze? “Ablaham kamtogola Mulungu, na Mulungu kampeta heyo kamba munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">MWANDUSO 15:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Munhu yosang'hanika, kitumetume chake hakiwa kamba nhunza, ila chowa kamba maliho gake. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Ila wanhu wopetigwa kamba wabule uzenzeleganye, sio sama ya sang'hano zao, ila sama ya nhamanila yao ha Mulungu, ayo yowagela kumgongo wanhu wali na vilozo. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Avo, vivija Daudi kozilonga motelo za munhu ayo Mulungu yampetile kamba kabule uzenzeleganye kutali na sang'hano.<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>“Wamota waja udulu wao ugeligwe kumgongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">na awo wasegezelwe vilozo vao!<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Kamota munhu ija Mndewa yoleka kumpetela vilozo!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">ZABULI 32:1-2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Motelo zino ha wanhu wengile kumbi weiyeka, ama vivija ha wanhu walekile kwingila kumbi? Tweye tulonga, “Nhamanila ya Ablaham iyo imtendile yawe bule uzenzeleganye.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Kipigiti chaki mbuli ino imulawila Ablaham? Viyakalile yang'hali hanakwingila kumbi ama viyeshile kwingila kumbi? Imulawila kipigiti hanakwingila kumbi, na sio kipigiti viyeshile kwingila kumbi. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Heyo kabokela kilaguso cha kwingila kumbi kamba utango wa kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kuyakalile nao kubitila nhamanila kipigiti viyakalile yang'hali hanakwingila kumbi. Avo heyo iyo tata wa waja wose wotogola bila kwingila kumbi, giladi wapetigwe kamba wabule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Na heyo vivija iyo tata wa awo wengile kumbi, sio awo wengile kumbi tu, ila awo vivija wotembela mkuiwinza nhamanila ija yaakalile nayo tata wetu Ablaham kipigiti viyakalile hanakwingila kumbi.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilagano cha Mulungu Chobokelwa Kubitila Nhamanila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Kwavija kilagano Mulungu chayailagane na Ablaham na lukolo lwake, kamba hewo wouhala ulumwengu, hakizile ha Ablaham ama ha lukolo lwake kubitila Malagizo ga Musa, ila sama ya kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kwizile kubitila nhamanila. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Kwavija kamba waja wogatamanila Malagizo ga Musa wao wahazi, nhamanila izabuka na ikilagano si kinhu. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Kwavija Malagizo ga Musa gago gogala lusango lwa Mulungu. Ila hanhu halibule Malagizo ga Musa, haduhu udulu wa Malagizo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Avo, kilagano chokwiza kubitila nhamanila, giladi kilavigwe bule kamba nhunza ya Mulungu mwa lukolo lose lwa Ablaham. Sio tu ha awo wogagoga Malagizo ga Musa, ila vivija ha awo wali na nhamanila kamba ya Ablaham. Kwavija heyo iyo tata wa tweye tose. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Nikutenda gweye uwe tata wa isi bwando.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">MWANDUSO 17:5</ref></char>.</note> Kilagano hicho kinoga haulongozi wa Mulungu yaamtamanile, ayo yowagwelela ugima wanhu wadanganhike na kuvikema vinhu vilihaduhu viwe baho. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Ablaham katamanila mbuli hazidahike kutamanilwa, katogola kokwiza kugaluka tata wa isi bwando, na kawa avo, kamba viyalongeligwe, “Avo kowa na wana bwando.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">MWANDUSO 15:5</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Nhamanila yake haihungule hata haja viyalugelegeze lukuli lwake mwenyego, lukalile behi na kudanganhika kwavija kakala na milao kamba mia, na vija viyamgelegeze Sala ayo yakalile bule sambo. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Haduhu kinhu chochose kimtendile yasinhe kukitogola kilagano cha Mulungu, ila kagendelela kuwa na mhiko mnhamanila yake kuno yomuyenzi Mulungu, <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>yotogola kamba Mulungu kodaha kugatenda gaja gayailagane. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Avo, sama ya nhamanila yake, “Kapetigwa kuwa munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">MWANDUSO 15:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Ila mbuli ilonga, “Kapetigwa,” handikiligwe heyo yeiyeka, <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>ila vivija sama yetu tweye, tondatupetigwe kuwa wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye, tweye tumtogole heyo yamzusile Yesu Mndewa wetu kulawa mkudanganhika. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Heyo kalavigwa giladi yadanganhike sama ya vilozo vetu, na kuzuswa kulawa mkudanganhika giladi tutendigwe wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuwa Bule Uzenzeleganye Hameso ga Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Avo, avija vitupetigwe kamba twabule uzenzeleganye hameso ga Mulungu kubitila nhamanila, tuna tindiwalo na Mulungu kubitila Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>ayo yatutendile tupate nzila kubitila nhamanila mbaka kwingila mngekewa ino itwimile nayo sambi. Na todeng'ha mditamanilo da yenzi ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Sio higo geiyeka, ila vivija toideng'hela migayo yetu kwavija tuvitanga kamba mgayo wogala mwazaganyo, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>na mwazaganyo woigangamiza nhogolwa inogile, na nhogolwa inogile yodigangamiza tamanilo da ukombola wetu. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Tamanilo dino haditutenda tunyunguale, kwavija Mulungu katwitila noge jake mmioyo yetu kubitila Loho wa Mulungu yaatugwelele tweye.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Vitukalile twabule mhiko, Kilisto keza mkipigiti kitogoligwe na kadanganhika sama ya tweye Wamhazi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Vidala munhu kudanganhika sama ya munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye. Ila vodahika munhu kudanganhika sama ya munhu yanogile. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Ila Mulungu kotulagusila tweye noge jake, avija Kilisto viyadanganhike sama yetu tweye, kipigiti vitukalile tung'hali na vilozo! <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Avo, avija vitupetigwe kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kubitila mulopa wake, yolagusa kotukombola ng'hani kulawa mulusango lwa Mulungu kubitila heyo! <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Tukala wadumuka wa Mulungu, ila katutenda kuwa wambwiga zake kubitila ifa ya Mwanage. Avija vitupetigwe kuwa wambwiga zake Mulungu, yolagusa kotukombola ng'hani kubitila ugima wake Kilisto! <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Ila sio higo geiyeka, ila vivija todeng'ha mgati mwa Mulungu kubitila Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, na kubitila heyo tuilumba na Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu na Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Avo, kamba vilozo vingila muulumwengu kubitila munhu imwe, na ifa iza kubitila vilozo, avo ifa yenela mwa wanhu wose, kwavija wanhu wose watenda vilozo. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Vilozo vikala baho muulumwengu songela Malagizo ga Musa haganalavigwa, ila vilozo havipetigwe kipigiti vikukalile haduhu Malagizo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Ifa itawala songela kipigiti cha Adamu mbaka kipigiti cha Musa, ifa iwatawala hata waja wakalile hawatendile vilozo va kugadulukila Malagizo, kamba viyatendile Adamu, ayo yalingile na Kilisto yondayeze. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Ila nhunza ya Mulungu hailingile kamba kilozo cha Adamu, kwavija kamba wanhu bwando wadanganhika kubitila kilozo cha munhu imwe, avo chowa kiasi kikulu ng'hani cha ngekewa ya Mulungu yondaize sama ya ngekewa ya munhu imwe yokemigwa Yesu Kilisto, iwetikila wanhu bwando! <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Nhunza ya Mulungu hailingile na malawililo ga kilozo cha munhu imwe. Kwavija nhaguso iwinza kilozo kimwe na igala msuno. Ila nhunza ya Mulungu iwinza vilozo bwando na iwatenda wanhu kuwa bule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Kwavija sama ya kilozo cha munhu imwe Adamu, ifa itawala wanhu bwando. Avo chowa kipigiti kikulu ng'hani chondawatawale awo wabokele ngekewa ya Mulungu na nhunza ya kuwa bule uzenzeleganye awo wokala mkuvihuma vilozo, kubitila ifa ya munhu ino, Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Avo, malawililo ga kilozo cha munhu imwe gakala nhaguso mwa wanhu wose, avo vivija malawililo ga sang'hano ya munhu imwe yalibule uzenzeleganye yowatenda wanhu wose wapetigwe kamba wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye, ija igala ugima mwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Kwavija kubitila udulu wa munhu imwe, wanhu bwando watendigwa wawe na vilozo, avo vivija kubitila wende wa munhu imwe, wanhu bwando watendigwa wawe bule uzenzeleganye.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Malagizo ga Musa vugezile, vilozo vongezeka. Ila hanhu vilozo havongezeke, ngekewa ya Mulungu yokongezeka ng'hani. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Avo, kamba vija vilozo vuvitawale na kugala ifa, avo vivija na ngekewa ya Mulungu yotawala kubitila kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, ako kutulongoza tweye kuugima wa digunge kubitila Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Vilozo Vogala Ifa, ila Kuilumba na Kilisto Kogala Ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Avo, tulongeze? Tugendelele kutenda vilozo giladi Mulungu yongeze ng'hani ngekewa yake? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Mmbuli ya vilozo tweye tudanganhika, todahaze kugendelela kukala m'vilozo? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Ham'vitanga kamba tweye tose tubatizigwa mkuilumba na Yesu Kilisto tubatizigwa mkuilumba muifa yake? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Avo, tuzikigwa hamoja nayo kubitila mbatiza ya kuilumba muifa yake, giladi kamba Kilisto viyazukile kulawa mkudanganhika kubitila mhiko ya yenzi ya Tata, vivija na tweye tukale ukazi wa sambi.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Kwavija ihawa tuilumba hamoja na heyo muifa iyadanganhike heyo, vivija toilumba hamoja na heyo mumzuso uwazukile heyo. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Tovitanga kamba unhu wetu wa umwaka uwambigwa mumsalaba hamoja na heyo, giladi vilozo sambiviwe na mhiko, sambituwe nyakadala wa vilozo. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Kwavija munhu yadanganhike mkuilumba na Kilisto kafunguligwa kulawa mmhiko za vilozo. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Ihawa tudanganhika hamoja na Kilisto, vivija totogola kamba tokwiza kukala hamoja na heyo. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Kwavija tovitanga kamba Kilisto kazuka kulawa mkudanganhika, avo hadanganhika mwanza uyagwe, na ifa haimtawala. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Ifa iyadanganhike, kadanganhika mwanza umwe sama ya vilozo va wanhu wose, ila ugima uyalinao, kokala sama ya yenzi ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Vivija na mweye wenyego mgelegeze kamba mmbuli ya vilozo mdanganhika, ila ha Mulungu muna ugima mkuilumba na Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Avo, sambimuleke vilozo vitawale mzing'huli zenu, mkuziwinza sulukila zihile za ng'huli zenu. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Sambim'vilave vipindi va ng'huli zenu viwe via va kutendela gehile, visang'hanike mkutenda vilozo. Ila vihanogile muilave wenyego ha Mulungu kamba awo wabwezigwe kulawa mkudanganhika na kuwa wagima, na m'vilave vipindi va ng'huli zenu ha Mulungu kamba via vilibule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Vilozo haviwatawala, kwavija hamuli hasi ya Malagizo ga Musa, ila mwa hasi ya ngekewa ya Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyakadala wa Mbuli Zilibule Uzenzeleganye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Avo tulongeze? Tutende vilozo kwavija hatuli hasi ya malagizo ila twa hasi ya ngekewa ya Mulungu? Si vivo! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Ham'vitanga kamba muhailava wenyego ha munhu yoyose kuwa nyakadala, mweye mwa nyakadala wa munhu ija imuilavile kumwake? Mdaha kuwa nyakadala wa vilozo viwalongoza kuna iifa, ama mdaha kuwa wende wa Mulungu kuwalongoza kulibule uzenzeleganye? <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Ila Mulungu yahewezigwe, kwavija mkala nyakadala wa vilozo, ila mgaluka wende kulawa mmioyo na kugawinza mafundo gamfundizigwe. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Mkomboligwa kulawa m'vilozo, na mgaluka nyakadala wa mbuli zilibule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Nolonga ulonzi wa kiunhu sama ya udaho mdodo umulinao. Kamba vija vum'vilavile vipindi venu viwe nyakadala wa vilozo na kuutenda wiho ubanze, avo sambi vilaveni viwe nyakadala wa mbuli zilibule uzenzeleganye zondaziwatende mng'ale.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Vumkalile nyakadala wa vilozo, mkala muilegehe kulawa mzimbuli zilibule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Avo, kinhu chaki chumpatile mkipigiti kija kulawa mzimbuli zumzonela kinyala sambi? Kwavija malawililo ga mbuli zija gakala ifa. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Ila sambi mkomboligwa kulawa m'vilozo na mgaluka nyakadala wa Mulungu. Kinhu chumpatile kicho ung'azi, na malawililo gake, ugima wa digunge. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Kwavija kitumetume cha vilozo kicho ifa, ila nhunza ya Mulungu iyo ugima wa digunge kubitila Yesu Kilisto Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmbuli ya Kusola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonga na wanhu wogatanga goya Malagizo ga Musa. Ham'vitanga kamba Malagizo gomfunga munhu kipigiti cha ugima wake tu? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Kamba vija mtwanzi yasoligwe kofungigwa na malagizo kipigiti mbigalo wake yang'hali mgima. Ila mbigalo wake yahadanganhika, kafunguligwa kulawa mmalagizo ga kusola na kusoligwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Kokemigwa mgoni kamba yahasoligwa na mbigalo iyagwe kipigiti mbigalo wake yali mgima. Ila kamba mbigalo wake yahadanganhika, kafunguligwa kulawa mdilagizo dija, na heyo hakemigwa mgoni, hata kamba yahasoligwa na mbigalo iyagwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Vivija na mweye, ndugu zangu, mdanganhika mmbuli ya Malagizo ga Musa kubitila lukuli lwa Kilisto, giladi muwe wanhu wa munhu iyagwe, heyo yazukile kulawa mkudanganhika giladi tumulelele mujo Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Vitukalile tukala ukazi wa kulongozigwa na ng'huli zetu, sulukila zetu za vilozo ziswagizwe na Malagizo ga Musa, zisang'hanika na vipindi vetu zilela mujo ugala ifa. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Ila sambi tufunguligwa kulawa Mmalagizo ga Musa, tudanganhika mmbuli zija zitufungile, giladi tweye sambituwe nyakadala wa Malagizo ga umwaka gandikigwe, ila tuwe nyakadala muukazi wa sambi wa Loho wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malagizo ga Musa na Vilozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Avo tulongeze? Kamba Malagizo ga Musa gago vilozo? Si vivo! Kamba kuhakalile haduhu Malagizo ga Musa, sambinivitange vilozo. Sambinivitange kamba kusulukila vinhu va wanhu kukala vilozo kamba Gamalagizo ga Musa sambigalonge, “Sambiusulukile vinhu va wanhu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">KUHALAWA 20:17</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 5:21">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 5:21</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Ila vilozo vipata nzila muindagizi ino kwinula sulukila zose zihile mgati yangu. Kwavija kamba kuhawile haduhu Malagizo ga Musa, vilozo vihadanganhike. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Kipigiti kimwe nikala bila kugatanga Malagizo ga Musa. Ila indagizi viizile, vilozo vipata ugima, <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>na nie nidanganhika. Na ndagizi iija ilongigwe yogala ugima, kumwangu nie igala ifa. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Kwavija vilozo vipata hanhu muindagizi ija, vinivwizila, na kubitila ndagizi hiyo ving'homa.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Avo, Malagizo ga Musa gang'ala, na indagizi ija ing'ala na yabule uzenzeleganye na inoga. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Kija kinogile kinigalila nie ifa? Si vivo! Vikala vilozo vigalile ifa mgati yangu kubitila kija kinogile, giladi vilozo voneke kuwa vilozo. Na kubitila indagizi ija, vilozo voneke kuwa viha ng'hani.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kugomba Mgati mwa Munhu Mwenyego</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Tuvitanga kamba Malagizo ga Musa simbuko jake loho, ila nie si munhu wa muloho, niguzigwa na kuwa nyakadala hasi ya vilozo. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Sigatanga gaja gonitenda. Kwavija gaja gonilonda kugatenda, sigatenda. Ila gaja gonigehila kugatenda, nogatenda. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Na ihawa nogatenda gaja gonilema kugatenda, notogola kamba Gamalagizo ga Musa ganoga. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Avo, sio nie mwenyego nigatenda gano, ila kilozo kili mgati yangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Novitanga kamba haduhu kinhu kinogile kikala mgati yangu, mulukuli lwangu. Kwavija nolonda kugatenda ganogile, ila sidaha kugatenda. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Kwavija sigatenda ganogile gonilonda kugatenda, ila gehile gonilema kugatenda, gago nigatenda. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Ihawa nogatenda gaja gonilema kugatenda, sio nie nigatenda higo, ila vilozo vikala mgati yangu.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Avo, nivitanga kamba nzoela ino yosang'hanika, nihalonda kugatenda ganogile, gehile gokwima haulongozi wangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Kwavija mgati yangu nogadeng'helela malagizo ga Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Ila nokona nzoela ziyagwe zosang'hanika m'vipindi va lukuli lwangu. Nzoela hizo zogomba na nzoela za nzonzi zangu na zonitenda nie niwe mfungigwa wa malagizo ga vilozo gosang'hanika m'vipindi vangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Nie munhu mkiwa! Yalihi yondayanikombole kulawa mulukuli luno lwa kudanganhika? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Mulungu yahewezigwe yogatenda gano kubitila Yesu Kilisto Mndewa wetu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Avo, nie mwenyego mzinzonzi zangu na nyakadala wa malagizo ga Mulungu, ila mulukuli na nyakadala wa malagizo ga vilozo.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Ugima Mgati ya Loho wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Avo, sambi haduhu nhaguso mwa wanhu waja wailumbile hamoja na Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Kwavija kubitila Yesu Kilisto, mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu zili na ugima zinikombola kulawa mmhiko za vilozo na ifa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Malagizo ga Musa galemelwa kutukombola tweye sama ya udonhi wa ng'huli zetu. Avo Mulungu kagatenda gaja galemelwe kutendigwa na Malagizo ga Musa. Kamtuma Mwanage mwenyego mulukuli kamba ng'huli zitulinazo tweye watenda vilozo. Na mulukuli luja Mulungu kakipeta kimambukizo cha vilozo vitutawale tweye mkumulava Mwanage kamba nhosa sama ya vilozo vetu, <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>giladi mbuli zilibule uzenzeleganye zilondeka na Gamalagizo ga Musa zivikile mgati yetu tweye tulekile kutamanila lukuli, ila tumtamanile Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Wanhu waja wose wokala mkuluwinza lukuli, nzonzi zao zogelegeza gaja golulonda lukuli. Na waja wose wokala mkumuwinza Loho wa Mulungu, nzonzi zao zogelegeza gaja goyolonda Loho ija. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Kuzitenda ngelegeza zenu zigelegeze mbuli za lukuli, kogala ifa. Ila kuzitenda ngelegeza zenu zigelegeze mbuli za Loho wa Mulungu, kogala ugima na tindiwalo. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Sama ya kilamso kino, nzonzi zitamanila lukuli zoibamilila na Mulungu, kwavija zogadulukila malagizo ga Mulungu, na hazidaha kugatogola. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Wanhu wolongozwa na sulukila za lukuli hawadaha kugatenda gaja gomnogela Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Ila mweye hamulongozigwa na lukuli, ila molongozigwa na Loho wa Mulungu, kwavija Loho wake kokala mgati yenu. Na munhu yoyose yalibule Loho wa Kilisto, heyo si munhu wa Kilisto. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Ila kamba Kilisto yahakala mgati yenu, hata kamba ng'huli zenu zihadanganhika sama ya vilozo, Loho wa Mulungu kowagwelela mweye ugima kwavija mtendigwa wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Ihawa Loho wake ayo yamzusile Yesu kulawa mkudanganhika kokala mgati yenu, heyo yamzusile Yesu Kilisto kulawa mkudanganhika vivija kozigwelela ugima ng'huli zenu zibanangika kubitila Loho wake, ayo yokala mgati yenu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, towilwa, ila si mkukala mkulongozwa na gaja golulonda lukuli. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Kwavija kamba mokala mkulongozigwa na lukuli, modanganhika. Ila kamba mokala mkulongozigwa na Loho wa Mulungu, mozikoma sang'hano za lukuli, na mowa wagima. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Kwavija wose awo wolongozigwa na Loho wa Mulungu, wao wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Kwavija Loho ija Mulungu iyawagwelele mweye hawatenda mweye muwe nyakadala na kuwagela bwembwe, ila mum'bokela Loho wake yowatenda muwe wana wa Mulungu. Na kubitila heyo tomkema, “Aba,” nhegulo yake “Tata.” <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Loho wa Mulungu kosindila hamoja na loho zetu kamba tweye twa wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Na kamba tweye twa wana, twa wahazi, twa wahazi wa Mulungu, na tohala hamoja na Kilisto, kamba tugazika hamoja nayo giladi vivija tuyenzigwe hamoja nayo.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yenzi Ikwiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Vinigesa nie migayo ya kipigiti kino haihile ng'hani uhailinga na yenzi yondatugubuliligwe tweye. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Kwavija vinhu vose vilumbigwe vobeta mkusulukila ng'hani kuno vitamanila wana wa Mulungu kufunuligwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Kwavija vinhu vilumbigwe viwa si kinhu, si mkulonda venyego, ila kamba vija viyalondile ayo yavilumbile. Ila kuna tamanilo, <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>vinhu vilumbigwe venyego vokwiza kukomboligwa kulawa m'vifungo vake va kubanangika na kugaligwa kuna iyenzi ya ulegeho wa wana wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Kwavija tovitanga kamba mbaka kipigiti kino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka kipigiti kino </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Paulo viyandike lupwilili luno.</char></note> vinhu vose vilumbigwe vogugumila na usungu kamba uja wa kulela mwana. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Na si vinhu vilumbigwe viiyeka vigugumila, ila na tweye wenyego, tuli na malimbuko ga Loho wa Mulungu, togugumila munda kwa munda kipigiti tubeta kutendigwa wana wa Mulungu, ukombola wa ng'huli zetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Kwavija tukomboligwa mditamanilo dino. Ila tamanilo dija dikoneka si tamanilo. Kwavija yalihi yotamanila kija ikinhu yeshile kuwa nacho? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Ila ihawa totamanila kinhu tuleka kuchona, tokibeta na mwazaganyo.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Vivija Loho wa Mulungu kotutaza muudonhi utulinao, kwavija hatuvitanga kutambika kamba vija vitulondigwa kutambika, ila Loho wa Mulungu kotambika sama yetu tweye mkugugumila mmbuli hazidahika kulongeka. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Na Mulungu, yogalola gali mmioyo ya wanhu, kozitanga ngelegeza za Loho wake, kwavija Loho wake kotambika sama ya wanhu wa Mulungu kamba vija voyolonda Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Tovitanga kamba Mulungu kowatendela ganogile awo iwamnogele mzimbuli zose, awo iyawakemile sama ya gaja goyolonda. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Kwavija waja Mulungu yawatangile songela mwaka, vivija kawasagula walinge kamba Mwanage, giladi Mwanage yawe chaudele wa mulango mkulu. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Na waja yawasagule, kawakema. Na waja yawakemile, kawapeta kamba wabule uzenzeleganye. Na waja yawapetile kamba wabule uzenzeleganye, kawayenzi.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Noge da Mulungu ha Yesu Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Avo, tulongeze mmbuli zino? Kamba Mulungu ka ng'ambu yetu, yalihi yondayadahe kuibamilila na tweye? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Heyo yalekile kumfisa Mwanage, ila kamulava sama yetu tweye tose. Avo, vivija kolekaze kutugwelela vinhu vose hamoja na Mwanage? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Yalihi yondayagale nhaguso yoyose mwa awo yawasagule Mulungu? Mulungu mwenyego iyo yawatendile wawe bule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Yalihi yondayatutaguse? Haduhu, kwavija Yesu Kilisto kadanganhika sama yetu na kazusigwa kawa mgima sama yetu, na kakala kumkono wa ukulume wa Mulungu, yotutambikila tweye! <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Yalihi yondayatubagule na noge da Kilisto? Mgayo, ama ukumbulu, ama kugazigwa, ama nzala, ama kuwa bule vivalo, ama mmwangalo, ama zele? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Sama yako gweye, todanganhika misi ngima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">tupetigwa kamba ng'hondolo yolondigwa kuchinjigwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">ZABULI 44:22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Bule, mzimbuli zino zose, tweye tubanziliza kuhuma kubitila heyo yatunogele. <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Kwavija notogola kamba si ifa, ama ugima, ama wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, ama vinyamkela, ama vinhu vili sambi, ama vinhu vondavize, ama mhiko zozose, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>ama ulumwengu wa uchana, ama ulumwengu wa hasi, ama kinhu chochose muna ivinhu vose vilumbigwe chondakidahe kutubagula na noge da Mulungu ha Yesu Kilisto Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu na Wanhu Zake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Nolonga ikweli na silonga uvwizi kwavija nie na hamoja na Kilisto, na udaho wangu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile hamoja na Loho wa Mulungu vosindila mbuli zino. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Moyo wangu umema usungu mkulu na giogio dilibule nziga <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>sama ya wanhu zangu, wandugu zangu wa Kiyahudi kwavija kamba nihadahile, nilonda nie mwenyego nihadukumizwe na kusegezigwa kulawa ha Kilisto kamba mkutenda vino wahakomboligwe. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Wanhu wa Islaeli, watendigwe wana, wagweleligwe yenzi ya Mulungu, wagweleligwe malagano, wagweleligwe Malagizo ga Musa, wagweleligwe mhome ya kumtambikila Mulungu, na wagweleligwe vilagano. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Hewo wao vilangizi, na kulawa kumwao kalawilila Kilisto mmbuli ya lukuli. Na Mulungu, ayo yotawala vinhu vose, yayenzigwe milongo yose! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Si kamba Usenga wa Mulungu uhumwa. Kwavija si wanhu wose wolawa mulukolo lwa Waislaeli wao Waislaeli kweli. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Sio wose wolawa mulukolo lwa Ablaham wanage Ablaham kwavija Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga, “Kubitila Isaka, lukolo lwako lokemigwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">MWANDUSO 21:12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Nhegulo yake iyo ino, sio wana wa lukuli wa Ablaham wali wana wa Mulungu, ila wana wa kilagano wao wopetigwa kamba lulo lukolo lwa Ablaham. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Kwavija vino vivo ikilagano vikilonga, “Kamba kipigiti kikino mulao ukwiza nobweleganya, na Sala kowa na mwana mbigalo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">MWANDUSO 18:10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 18:14">14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Sio gano geiyeka, kinhu kilingile na kino kimulawilila Lebeka ahaja viyapatile inda ya wana wabili kulawa ha mbigalo imwe, yokemigwa Isaka tata wetu. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Hata viwakalile hawanavumbuka, ama hawanatenda kinhu chochose kinogile ama kihile, giladi ija iyamulondile Mulungu kumsagula yapatikane, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>sio sama ya gaja gayatendile, ila kubitila lukemo lwake, Lebeka kalongeligwa, “Mkulu komsang'hanikila mdodo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">MWANDUSO 25:23</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Yakobo nimnogela, ila Esau nimwihila.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">MALAKI 1:2-3</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Avo, tulongeze? Kuna uzenzeleganye ha Mulungu? Si vivo! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Kwavija kamulongela Musa, “Nomgela kumgongo ayo inimulonda kumgela kumgongo, na nomonela bazi ayo inimulonda kumonela bazi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">KUHALAWA 33:19</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Avo, haitamanila vija viyosulukila munhu ama vija viyokiiyoha, ila yotamanila bazi da Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Kwavija Nyandiko Zing'alile zomulonga Falao, “Nikwinula sama ya kulagusa mhiko zangu mgati yako, giladi twaga jangu dipetigwe kila hanhu muisi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">KUHALAWA 9:16</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Avo, Mulungu komonela bazi, munhu yoyose yoolonda kumonela bazi, na komgela moyo udala, munhu yoyose yoolonda kumgela moyo udala.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lusango na Bazi da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Abaho moniuza, “Habali Mulungu yang'hali yotulonga? Yalihi yodaha kugadulukila gaja goyolonda?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Ila gweye iyo munhu yalihi hata um'bamilile Mulungu? Kinhu kitendigwe kimulongele ayo yakitendile, “Habali kunitenda nie kamba vino?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">ISAYA 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Vino muumbi hadaha kulamula kuumba kulawa mditonge dimwe da ulongo kia kimwe kisinyo, na kia kiyagwe cha sang'hano za mazua gose?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Vivija hata kamba Mulungu kana udaho wa kulagusa lusango lwake na mhiko zake, ila heyo kowazaganya ng'hani awo yoowonela lusango, awo walumbile kubanangigwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Na ihawile vilihi kamba katenda gano giladi yatende ugoli wa yenzi yake utangigwe mwa awo wapatile bazi jake, awo yawatandile yenzi yake, <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>na hata tweye yatukemile, sio kulawa ha Wayahudi weiyeka, ila vivija kulawa ha Wamhazi? <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Kamba viyalongile muna ikitabu cha Hosea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Waja wakalile si wanhu zangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">nowakema, ‘Wanhu zangu.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Na ayo nilekile kumnogela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">nomkema, ‘Mnogelwa wangu.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">HOSEA 2:23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Na hanhu hahaja hawalongeligwe, ‘Mweye sio wanhu zangu,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">bahaja wokemigwa, ‘wana wa Mulungu yali na ugima.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">HOSEA 1:10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Na Isaya kenula dizwi yoilonga Islaeli, kalonga, “Hata kamba mheta ya wana wa Waislaeli yowa kamba misenga ya mumgwazo wa ibahali, ila wondawakomboligwe wowa wadodo, <verse eid="ROM 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>kwavija Mndewa koitenda nhaguso yake muisi mbwisa na kuimambukiza.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">ISAYA 10:22-23</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Kamba Isaya viyahokole, yolonga, “Kamba Mndewa Mwene Udaho sambiyatulekele wana, tuhawile kamba Sodoma, na tuhalingile na Gomola.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">ISAYA 1:9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Koitambikila Islaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Avo, tulongeze? Wamhazi, awo walekile kuzahila kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, wasegezeligwa uzenzeleganye kubitila nhamanila. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Ila Waislaeli, wakalile woiyoha mkuzahila kuwa bule uzenzeleganye mkugawinza Malagizo ga Musa, hawapatile kuwa bule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Habali hawapatile? Kwavija hawakuzahile kubitila nhamanila, ila kubitila kugagoga Malagizo ga Musa. Waikwangwala hana didibwe da kuikwala. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Lola! Ako Sayuni nokwika dibwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">dondadiwatende wanhu waikwale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">dibwe dondadiwatende walagale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Ila munhu yoyose yondayamtogole hageligwa kinyala.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">ISAYA 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:16">28:16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ndugu zangu, sulukila ya moyo wangu na nhambiko yangu ha Mulungu nolonda wanhu wa Islaeli wakomboligwe! <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Kinidaha kulonga mmbuli ya wanhu wano icho kino, kamba wokiiyoha ng'hani kumzahila Mulungu. Ila vija viwomzahila, hawamzahila na nzewele. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Kwavija hawaitangile nzila ya kuwa bule uzenzeleganye ilawa ha Mulungu, ila wozahila kutenda mbuli zao wenyego, avo hawatogole kulongozigwa na nzila ya Mulungu ya kuwatenda wawe bule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Kwavija Kilisto kakigala ikimambukizo cha Malagizo ga Musa, giladi wanhu wose wotogola wapetigwe kuwa bule uzenzeleganye.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanhu Wose Wolondigwa Wakomboligwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Mmbuli ya nzila ya kuwa bule uzenzeleganye ilawa mkugagoga Malagizo ga Musa, Musa kandika vino, “Munhu yoyose yogagoga malagizo gali Mmalagizo ga Musa kowa mgima kubitila Malagizo higo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">MBULI ZA WALAWI 18:5</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Ila mbuli ya kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, ikwiza kulawa mnhamanila, yolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:6">“sambiulonge mmoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:6">‘Yalihi yondayakwele mbaka kuulanga?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:13">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 30:13</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:6">nhegulo yake, kumuhumulusa hasi Kilisto.<verse eid="ROM 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Ama sambiulonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:7">‘Yalihi yondayahumuluke mbaka kuzimu?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:13">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 30:13</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:7">nhegulo yake, kumwinula Kilisto kulawa mkudanganhika.”<verse eid="ROM 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Ila Nyandiko Zing'alile zolongaze? “Usenga wa Mulungu wa habehi nagwe, mmulomo wako na mmoyo wako.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:14">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 30:14</ref></char>.</note> Uno uwo usenga wa nhamanila utuwapetela wanhu. <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Kwavija kamba uhatogola na mulomo wako kamba Yesu iyo Mndewa na kutogola mmoyo wako kamba Mulungu kamzusa kulawa mkudanganhika, kokomboligwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Kwavija munhu yahatamanila mmoyo wake kopetigwa kamba kabule uzenzeleganye, na munhu yahatogola na mulomo wake kokomboligwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga, “Munhu yoyose yomtamanila hageligwa kinyala.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">ISAYA 28:16</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Kwavija Muyahudi na Mmhazi haduhu yam'banzile miyage. Wana Mndewa imwe, na iyo Mndewa wa wose, yowamemeza motelo wose awo womkema. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Kwavija, “Munhu yoyose yodikema twaga da Mndewa kokomboligwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">YOELI 2:32</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Avo wodahaze kumkema ayo walekile kumtogola? Na wodahaze kumtogola ayo walekile kumuhulika? Na wodahaze kumuhulika bila munhu kuwapetela? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Na wodahaze kuupeta Usenga Unogile kamba hawatumigwe? Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Ganoga ng'hani magulu ga awo wougala Usenga Unogile!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">ISAYA 52:7</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Ila sio wose wautogole Usenga Unogile. Kwavija Isaya kalonga, “Mndewa, yalihi yautogole usenga wetu?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">ISAYA 53:1</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Avo, nhamanila mwanduso wake kuhulika, kuuhulika Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Ila nouza, hewo hawahulike? Si vivo, wahulika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Dizwi jao jenela muisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">na mbuli zao zenela mbaka hana zisota za ulumwengu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">ZABULI 19:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Nouza kabili, Waislaeli hawavitangile? Tanhu Musa kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Nowatenda mweye mwone migongo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">mwa awo wali si isi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">na nowatenda mweye muwe na lusango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">na isi ija ilibule nzewele.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 32:21</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Isaya kagangamiza kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Nyoneka na awo walekile kunizahila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">na nikiifunula mwenyego mwa awo walekile kunipula.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">ISAYA 65:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Ila mmbuli ya Islaeli kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">“Imisi ngima nigolosa makono gangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">kuwabokela wanhu awo walekile kutogola na wadulu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">ISAYA 65:2</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Kowonela Bazi Waislaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Avo nouza, Mulungu kawalema wanhu zake? Si vivo! Nie mwenyego na Muislaeli, lukolo lwa Ablaham, kulawa mtala wa Benjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Mulungu hawalemile wanhu zake, awo yaawasagule songela mwaka. Ham'vitanga vija Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga mmbuli ya Eliya, vija viyawataguse Waislaeli ha Mulungu? <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>“Mndewa, wawakoma wahokozi zako na kuvibomola vilingo vako va kulavila nhosa. Ila nie niiyeka nisigale, na hewo wouzahila ugima wangu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1WANDEWA 19:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Ila Mulungu kamwidika vilihi? “Nikiikila mwenyego wanhu alufu saba walekile kumfugamila mavindi Baali, mulungu wa uvwizi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1WANDEWA 19:18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Vivija mkipigiti kino hana wanhu wadodo wasaguligwe kubitila ngekewa ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Usaguzi wake utamanila ngekewa yake, na sio kija kiwasang'hane. Kwavija kamba usaguzi wa Mulungu uhatamanile kija kiwasang'hane wanhu, avo ngekewa yake sambiiwe ngekewa ya kweli.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Avo, Waislaeli walemelwa kukipata kija kiwakalile wokizahila? Waja wasaguligwe wakipata, ila wasigale wakala na mioyo midala. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Mulungu kawagwelela moyo wa ubozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">giladi meso gao sambigadahe kulola</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">na magwiti gao sambigadahe kuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">mbaka zua dino.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 29:4">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 29:4</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:10">ISAYA 29:10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Na Daudi kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Sona zao zigaluke tanzi na mtego,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">lwingila na msuno ulingile na gaja gawatendile!<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Meso gao gageligwe ziza giladi sambiwadahe kulola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">na migongo yao iveduke milongo yose!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:22-23">ZABULI 69:22-23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Avo nowauza, Wayahudi waikwala na kugwa hasi kabisa? Si vivo! Ila sama ya vilozo viwatendile, ukombola uchola ha Wamhazi, avo kuwatenda Waislaeli wone migongo. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Vilozo va Wayahudi vigala ugoli muulumwengu, na ukumbulu wao wa muloho ugala ugoli ha Wamhazi. Avo, Wayahudi wahaibokela nhunza ya ukombola wa Mulungu, wogala ugoli mkulu ng'hani muulumwengu!<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukombola wa Wamhazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Nowalongela mweye Wamhazi, kwavija nie na mtumigwa wa Kilisto ha Wamhazi, noiyenzi sang'hano yangu <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>giladi niwatende wanhu wa isi yangu mwenyego wone migongo, na niwakombole wayagwe mmwanza wao. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Ihawa kulemigwa kumwao kutenda ulumwengu uilumbe na Mulungu, avo yowaze aho vondawatogoligwe? Yowa ugima ha awo wadanganhike.<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Kamba kidanga cha ichanduso cha mkate kilavigwe ha Mulungu king'ala, avo mkate wose usigale ung'ala. Na kamba mizizi ing'ala, na gamatambi gang'ala. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Ila kamba matambi gayagwe ga mzaituni gakanhigwa, na mweye, muli matambi ga mzaituni muhulo, muombekigwe hanhu hagakalile matambi gaja gakanhigwe na sambi moja ugoli wa mzizi wa mzaituni, <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>avo sambimgazabuze matambi ago gakalile gakanhigwe. Kamba muhagazabuza, mgelegeze kamba sio mweye muugogile umzizi, ila umzizi uwo uwagogile mweye.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Gweye kolonga, “Matambi gakanhigwa giladi nie niombekigwe.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Ona, vivo ili! Ila wakanhigwa sama ya kuleka kutogola kumwao, ila gweye kwima kubitila nhamanila. Avo sambiuitope, ila udumbe. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Kwavija kamba Mulungu hagalekile matambi gali si ga kuombeka, siku na gweye hakuleka. <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Avo, mgelegeze unovu na ukali wa Mulungu. Ukali wa Mulungu mwa awo watendile vilozo, ila unovu wa Mulungu kumwenu ulavigwa ihawa mogendelela kukala muunovu wake. Ila kamba si hivo, vivija na mweye mokanhigwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Na hata Wayahudi, kamba wahagaluka na kutogola, woombekigwa, kwavija Mulungu kana udaho wa kuwaombeka kabili. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Kwavija kamba mkanhigwa kulawa mumzaituni muhulo, na muombekigwa mumzaituni kae uli na simbuko diyagwe, vobuha ng'hani matambi gano ga mzaituni kae kuombekigwa kabili kumzaituni kugakalile.<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Kowonela Bazi Wanhu Wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonda muitange nyong'onyo ino giladi sambimgelegeze kamba muna nzewele ng'hani kubanza vimuli. Udala wa mioyo ya wanhu wa Waislaeli haugendelela, ila womalila haja mheta yose ya Wamhazi vondaize ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Avo Waislaeli wose wokomboligwa, kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Mkombola kokwiza kulawa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">na kuusegeza umhazi kulawa mulukolo lwa Yakobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Na dino dijo lagano jangu dondaniilagane nawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">kipigiti vondaniwasegezele vilozo vao.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 27:9">ISAYA 27:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:20-21">59:20-21</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:33-34">YELEMIA 31:33-34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Kwavija waulema Usenga Unogile, Wayahudi wawa wadumuka wa Mulungu sama yenu mweye Wamhazi. Ila kwavija Mulungu kawasagula Wayahudi, wawa mbwiga zake sama ya wahenga zao. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Kwavija nhunza ya Mulungu na lukemo lwake havigaluka. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Umwaka, mweye Wamhazi, mkala mumdulukile Mulungu, ila sambi m'bokela bazi jake sama ya udulu wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Avo na hewo Wayahudi sambi womdulukila Mulungu, giladi kubitila bazi da Mulungu dim'bokele mweye Wamhazi, na hewo Wayahudi vivija wadibokele. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Kwavija Mulungu kawafunga wanhu wose mkifungo cha udulu, giladi yawonele bazi wanhu wose.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Atogolwe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Lola Mulungu viyali na bwando da ugoli, ng'hungwe na ilimu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Yalihi yodaha kupeta ulamuzi wake?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Na yalihi yodaha kuzitanga nzila zake?<verse eid="ROM 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“Kwavija yalihi yozitanga ngelegeza za Mndewa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Ama yalihi yondayawe mulangulizi wake?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">ISAYA 40:13</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Yalihi yamgwelele kinhu chochose Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">giladi Mulungu yam'bwezele?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">AYUBU 41:11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Kwavija vinhu vose vilawa kumwake, na vinhu vose vabaha sama yake, na vinhu vose vabaha sama ya kumuyenzi Mulungu. Mulungu yayenzigwe milongo yose. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Ugima Muna Isang'hano ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, kubitila bazi da Mulungu, nowayalalila zilaveni ng'huli zenu kamba nhosa ili na ugima, ing'alile na imnogela Mulungu, kwavija ino iyo nhambiko yenu ya ikweli. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Sambimuukweleleze ulumwengu uno, ila muhindulwe mkutendigwa wa sambi mnzewele, avo mdahe kulanza na kugatanga gaja goyolonda Mulungu, gaja ganogile, gomnogela na vija viyalekile kuhungula hanhu.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Kwavija kubitila bazi dinigweleligwe, nomulongela kila munhu mmwanza wenu, kamba sambimuigelegeze wenyego kamba mweye mwa uchana ng'hani kubanza vija vimuli, ila muwe bule uzenzeleganye mkuigelegeza wenyego, mkuipima wenyego na nhamanila iyawagwelele Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Kamba vituli tweye tuna lukuli lumwe luli na vipindi bwando, na vipindi vino vose havitenda sang'hano imwe, <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>na vivija, tweye tuli bwando, twa lukuli lumwe kubitila Kilisto, na kila kipindi choilumba na miyage. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Tusang'hanike na nhunza zetu zilekile kuilinga, kulingana na ngekewa ya Mulungu iyatugwelele kila munhu mmwanza wetu. Kamba munhu kana nhunza ya kuhokola, basi yahokole kulingana na nhamanila iyalinayo, <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>kamba kusang'hanika, basi yasang'hanike, kamba kufundiza, basi yafundize, <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>kamba kuwagangamiza wanhu, basi yawagangamize, kamba kuwasangila vinhu wanhu wayagwe, basi yawasangile na moyo unogile, kamba kuwalongoza wanhu, basi yawalongoze mkuiyoha, na kamba kuwonela bazi wanhu, basi yawonele bazi na moyo usamhuke.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Noge sambidiwe da uzenzeleganye. Mkihile kija kihile, ila mkigoge kija kinogile. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Muinogele wenyego kwa wenyego kubitila noge da udugu. Na mkiihishimile wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Sambimdonhe kuinanahila nhamanila yenu, ila muiyohe muloho mkumsang'hanikila Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Deng'heni mditamanilo, mwazaganye mmigayo, na mtambike mazua gose. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Muwasangile vinhu wanhu wa Mulungu wali wakumbulu, na mazua gose sulukileni kuwatendela wahenza ganogile.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Wamotezeni awo wowagaza mweye. Wamotezeni, na sambimuwadukumize. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Deng'heni na awo wodeng'ha, na lileni na awo wolila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Muilumbe mwemwe kwa mwemwe. Sambimuitope, ila igogeni na wanhu wali hasi yenu, sambimgelegeze kamba muna nzewele ng'hani kubanza vija vumuli.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Sambimmulihe munhu yoyose dihile kwa dihile, ila gezeni kutenda ganogile hameso ga wanhu wose. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Tendeni jojose didahika giladi mkale mditindiwalo na wanhu wose. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Mbwiga zangu, sambimuibwelezele gehile, ila lulekeni lusango lwa Mulungu lusang'hanike, kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “ ‘Nie iyo yondanim'bwelezele munhu gehile, nie noliha,’ kolonga Mndewa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 32:35</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Ila, “Kamba mdumuka wako yahawa na nzala, mgwelele mandia yaje, na yahawa na ng'hilu, mgwelele kinhu cha kung'wa yang'we. Kwavija mkutenda vino, komwikila ming'hea ya moto mpala jake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">LONZI 25:21-22</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Sambiuhumigwe na gehile, ila ugahume gehile mkutenda ganogile.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuwahishimila Watawala wa Isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Kila munhu sambiyaidulukile silikali itawala, kwavija haduhu silikali haikigwe na Mulungu. Silikali zose zitawala sambi zikigwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Avo yoyose yoidulukila silikali kokidulukila kija kisaguligwe na Mulungu, na waja wose woidulukila woigalila nhaguso hewo wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Kwavija watawala hawawadumbiza awo wotenda ganogile, ila mwa awo wotenda gehile. Kolonda sambiuwe na bwembwe haulongozi wa mtawala? Avo tenda ganogile, na gweye kopata nhogolwa kulawa kumwake, <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>kwavija hewo wao watumigwa wa Mulungu wowasang'hanikila mweye ganogile. Ila kamba uhatenda gehile, udumbe, kwavija watawala hawamwinulila munhu zele bila kilamso. Hewo wao watumigwa wa Mulungu, woluvikiza lusango lwa Mulungu ha watenda gehile. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Avo, kolondigwa kuwahishimila watawala, sio tu sama ya lusango lukwiza, ila sama ya udaho wa kusambula gehile na ganogile.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Kwavija kino kicho kilamso cha mweye kuliha kodi, kwavija watawala womsang'hanikila Mulungu, awo wolava kipigiti chao chose mkutawala. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Mgweleleni kila munhu choyolondigwa kugweleligwa. Muwila kodi, yagweleligwe kodi, munhu wa ushulu, yagweleligwe ushulu, munhu yolondigwa kuhishimilwa, yahishimilwe, na munhu yolondigwa kudumbigwa, yadumbigwe.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuwanogela Wayagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Sambimuwilwe na munhu yoyose, ila kinhu kimulondigwa kuwilwa kicho kino, inogeleni wenyego kwa wenyego, kwavija ayo yowanogela wayagwe kagavikiza Malagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Kwavija ndagizi zilonga, “sambiutende ugoni, sambiukome, sambiwibe, sambiusulukile vinhu va miyago,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 2:13-15">KUHALAWA 2:13-15</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 2:17">17</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 5:17-19</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:21">21</ref></char>.</note> na ndagizi zose ziyagwe za hasi ya ndagizi ino imwe ilonga, “Mnogele munhu wa habehi nagwe kamba vukiinogela mwenyego.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">MBULI ZA WALAWI 19:18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Noge hadimtendela gehile munhu wa habehi nagwe. Avo noge dogavikiza Malagizo ga Musa.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Na mkitange kipigiti kitulinacho. Kipigiti kivika cha mweye kulamuka kulawa muutulo. Kwavija ukombola wetu ukwenhuka ng'hani kubanza vitusongile kutogola. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Kilo kigendelela ng'hani, na misi ikwenhuka. Avo tuzike hamgwazo sang'hano za ziza, na kuvala via va kuiimilizila va mulangaza. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Tukale ukazi wa kuihishimila kamba wanhu wa imisi, sambituwe wamelo na sambitung'we ugimbi, sambituwe wagoni na washalati, sambitugombe na kuiyonela migongo. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Ila mum'vale Mndewa Yesu Kilisto, sambimzikweleleze sulukila zihile za ng'huli zenu mkutenda vija vuzilonda.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Sambimuitaguse Wenyego kwa Wenyego</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Wabokeleni awo wali na nhamanila ndodo, ila sambimuibamilile nao sama ya ngelegeza zao. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Nhamanila ya munhu imwe yomtogoza kuja vinhu vose, ila munhu iyagwe yali na nhamanila hainakangala koja mboga za matepo geiyeka. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Munhu yoja vinhu vose sambiyamzabuze ayo yoleka kuja vinhu vose, na munhu yoleka kuja vinhu vose, sambiyamtaguse munhu ayo yoja vinhu vose, kwavija Mulungu kamtogola. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Avo gweye kwa munhu yalihi hata umtaguse mtumigwa wa munhu iyagwe? Mndewa wake mwenyego iyo yondayalamule kamba yadahe ama yalemelwe. Na heyo kokwima, kwavija Mndewa Mulungu kodaha kumtenda yeme.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Munhu imwe kogelegeza kamba zua dimwe ding'ala ng'hani kubanza zua diyagwe, na munhu iyagwe kogelegeza kamba mazua gose galinga. Kila munhu yawinze vija nzonzi zake vuzimulongoza. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Awo womtambikila Mulungu mdizua kisinyo, wotenda avo sama ya kumuhishimila Mndewa. Vivija awo woja vakuja vose, woja sama ya kumuhishimila Mndewa, kwavija womgwelela Mulungu hewela. Na awo woleka kuja, hawaja sama ya kumuhishimila Mndewa na kumgwelela Mulungu hewela. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Kwavija haduhu munhu mmwanza wetu yodaha kuwa mgima mkulonda mwenyego, na vivija haduhu munhu mmwanza wetu yodaha kudanganhika mkulonda mwenyego. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Ihawa towa wagima, towa wagima sama ya Mndewa, na ihawa todanganhika, todanganhika sama ya Mndewa. Avo, ihawa towa wagima ama todanganhika, tweye twa wanhu wa Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Mkilamso kino, Kilisto kadanganhika na kuzuka giladi yawe Mndewa wa wose wadanganhike na wali wagima. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Habali umtagusa ndugu yako? Ama habali umzabuza ndugu yako? Kwavija tweye tose tokwima haulongozi wa kigoda cha nhaguso cha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Mndewa kolonga, ‘Nowalongela ikweli kamba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">kila vindi donifugamila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">na kila lulimi lotogola kamba nie iyo Mulungu.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">ISAYA 45:23</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Avo, kila munhu mmwanza wetu kozipeta mbuli zake mwenyego ha Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambimuilagaze M'vilozo Wenyego kwa Wenyego</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Avo, tuleke kuitagusa wenyego kwa wenyego. Ila zigalule nzewele zako, uleke kwika kikwangwazi ama king'hwaso mnzila ya ndugu yako. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Novitanga na notogola mkuilumba na Mndewa Yesu kamba haduhu kinhu chochose kinyolodoke kihawa chenyego. Ila kamba munhu yahakigelegeza kamba kinyolodoka, basi kinhu hicho kinyolodoka ha munhu hiyo. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Kamba ndugu yako yahanyunguala sama ya kija chuuja, hauli mdinoge. Sambiumbanange ndugu yako sama ya kija chuuja kwavija Kilisto kadanganhika sama yake. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Avo sambimtogole kija kimgelegeza kamba kinoga kilongigwe kamba kiha. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu sio kuja na kung'wa, ila kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, tindiwalo, na ndeng'ha mgati ya Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yomsang'hanikila Kilisto muinzila ino, kotenda gamnogele Mulungu na kutogoligwa na wanhu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Avo tuiyohe ng'hani kutenda gaja gondagatulongoze kuditindiwalo, na kuigangamiza wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Sambiuibanange nhamanila yaaikile Mulungu mgati ya munhu sama ya mandia. Mandia gose ganoga, ila havilumbile munhu kuja kinhu chochose kimtenda miyage yagwile m'vilozo. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Vihanogile kuleka kuja nyama, ama kung'wa divai, ama kutenda kinhu chochose chondakimtende ndugu yako yagwile m'vilozo. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Chochose chuutogola mzimbuli zino kikale hagatigati yako mwenyego na Mulungu. Kamota munhu ayo yoleka kuidukumiza mwenyego sama ya kija choyokitogola. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Ila munhu yosinhasinha sama ya kija choyolonda kuja basi sambiyaje, yahaja kotenda vilozo, kwavija kabule nhamanila ya kinhu kija choyoja. Na kinhu chochose kitendeka bila nhamanila chowa kilozo.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Wanogele Wayagwe, Sambiuinogele Mwenyego</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Tweye tuli na mhiko tolondigwa kuwataza mbuli ziwahumwile waja walibule mhiko, na sambituinogele tweye wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Kila munhu mmwanza wetu yamtendele ganogile munhu wa habehi yake mnia inogile ya kumgangamiza. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Kwavija hata Kilisto hakiinogele mwenyego, ila kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Maligo gaja gawakuligile gweye, ganigwila nie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">ZABULI 69:9</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Vinhu vose vandikigwe umwaka vandikigwa giladi vitufundize tweye, giladi kubitila mwazaganyo na kugangamizwa na Nyandiko Zing'alile tuwe na tamanilo. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Na Mulungu, ayo yolava mwazaganyo na kugangamizwa, yawagwelele loho ya kuilumba hamoja wenyego kwa wenyego, kipigiti vumumkoleleza Yesu Kilisto, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>giladi mose hamoja mmuyenzi Mulungu na Tata wa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto na dizwi dimwe.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usenga Unogile ha Wamhazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Avo mwibokele wenyego kwa wenyego, kamba Kilisto viyawabokele mweye, sama ya yenzi ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Kwavija nowalongela kamba Kilisto keza kamba mtumigwa wa Wayahudi kulagusa kamba Mulungu kabule uzenzeleganye m'vilagano viyavitendile ha wahenga zao, <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>giladi Wamhazi wamuyenzi Mulungu sama ya bazi jake. Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Avo nokutogola mdidale da Wamhazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">na kwimba nyila za kudiyenzi twaga jako.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2SAMWELI 22:50</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 18:49">ZABULI 18:49</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Vivija zolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Deng'heni, Wamhazi, hamoja na wanhu zake!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 32:43</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Na vivija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Wamhazi wose, mmuyenzi Mndewa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Na wanhu wose, mmuyenzi heyo!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">ZABULI 117:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Vivija Isaya kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Kolawila munhu kulawa mulukolo lwa Yese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ayo yondayenuke yawatawale Wamhazi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">na hewo womtamanila heyo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">ISAYA 11:10</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Mulungu wa tamanilo yawamemeze ndeng'ha yose na tindiwalo kamba vija vimumtamanila, giladi mmemezwe na tamanilo kubitila mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilamso cha Paulo Kwandika Mkuidandaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Ndugu zangu, nie mwenyego notogola kamba mweye wenyego mmema unovu, na mmemezwa ilimu yose, na modaha kuifundiza wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Niwandikila mweye kuno nikiidandaya mmbuli ziyagwe kamba kuwakumbusa kabili, sama ya bazi diyangwelele Mulungu <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>da kuwa msang'hana wa Yesu Kilisto ha Wamhazi, msang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko ya kuupeta Usenga Unogile wa Mulungu, giladi Wamhazi wawe nhosa itogolwe na Mulungu, ing'alizwe na Loho wake. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Avo, kubitila Yesu Kilisto, nna kilamso cha kuitopela sang'hano yangu ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Sigeza kulonga kinhu chochose ila kija kiyatendile Kilisto kubitila nie mkuwalongoza Wamhazi wamtogole Mulungu kubitila gaja ganilongile na kugatenda, <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>kubitila mhiko za vilaguso na mikanganyo, kubitila mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu. Avo kulawa Yelusalemu mbaka viwambo vose vizunguluka Ililiko, niupeta ng'hani Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Sulukila yangu mazua gose ikala kuupeta Usenga Unogile hanhu Kilisto hanatangigwa, giladi sambinizenge hayasongile kuzenga munhu iyagwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Awo wakalile hawanalongeligwa mbuli zake, womona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">na awo wakalile hawanamuhulika, womtanga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">ISAYA 52:15</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kofunga Mwanza wa Kuchola Mdiwambo da Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Kino kicho kilamso cha nie kugomesigwa mianza bwando kwiza kumwenu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Ila sambi haduhu hanhu hayagwe muisi ino ha nie kusang'hanika, na avija vinikalile nisulukila mmilao bwando kwiza kumwenu, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>nogelegeza kutenda avo kipigiti vondanichole muisi ya Sipania. Notamanila kuwatembelela mweye vondanibitile aho. Tuhesha kukala hamoja mkipigiti kidodo, munisangile sama ya mwanza wangu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Ila, sambi nochola Yelusalemu kuwasang'hanikila wanhu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Kwavija wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali muisi za Makedonia na Akaya wanogelwa kuwasangila wakumbulu wamtogole Kilisto wali Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Wanogelwa kutenda vino, kweli walondigwa kuwatendela vino. Kwavija Wayahudi wawagwelela Wamhazi vinhu vao va muloho, na Wamhazi wolondigwa kuwagwelela Wayahudi motelo zao zowopata muulumwengu. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Avo nihaimambukiza sang'hano ino, na kuwavikizila kija kisangigwe, nosonga mwanza wa kuchola Sipania nibitila kumwenu. <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Novitanga kamba niheza kumwenu, nokwiza na motelo bwando za Kilisto.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Ndugu zangu, nowayalalila mditwaga da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto na mdinoge da Loho wa Mulungu, mwilumbe na nie mumgayo wangu mkunitambikila ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Tambikeni kamba nikomboligwe kulawa ha wanhu walekile kumtogola Kilisto ako Yudea, na kamba sang'hano yangu ako Yelusalemu itogoligwe na wanhu wa Mulungu wali hiko, <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>giladi vihamnogela Mulungu, nize kumwenu na ndeng'ha, na mhate kuhumula hamoja na mweye. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Mulungu wa tindiwalo yakale na mweye mose. Amina.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kowalamsa Wanhu wa Mdiwambo da Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Nomwika mmakono genu lumbu jetu Foibe, shemasi wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto ako mdiwambo da Kenikilea. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>M'bokeleni mditwaga da Mndewa, kamba vowolondigwa kutenda wanhu wa Mulungu wang'alile, mgweleleni kinhu chochose choyolonda kulawa kumwenu, kwavija kawataza wanhu bwando hamoja na nie mwenyego.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Walamseni Pilisila na Akuila, wasang'hana wayangu msang'hano ya Yesu Kilisto, <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>awo wauhonzile ugima wao sama yangu nie. Sio nie niiyeka niwaheweza, ila vivija na Wamhazi wose wamtogole Kilisto. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Vivija walamseni wanhu wamtogole Kilisto awo woiting'hana mng'anda yao.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Mulamseni mbwigaangu Epaineto, ayo yakalile wa mwanduso kum'bokela Kilisto muisi ya Asia. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Mulamseni Maliamu, ayo yawasang'hanikile mweye ng'hani. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Mulamseni Enduloniko na Yunia, Wayahudi wayangu wakalile mkifungo hamoja na nie, awo watangigwe ng'hani mmwanza wa watumigwa wa Kilisto, na hewo wanilongola nie mkumtogola Kilisto.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Mulamseni Ampiliato, mbwigaangu muuhamoja na Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Mulamseni Alibano, msang'hana mietu hamoja na Kilisto, na mbwigaangu Sitaku. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Mulamseni Apele, ayo yatogoligwe na Kilisto. Walamseni awo wali mng'anda ya Alistobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Mulamseni Muyahudi miyangu Helodiana. Walamseni awo wamtogole Mndewa wali mng'anda ya Nakiso.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Walamseni Tulufena na Tulufosa, awo wosang'hanika sama ya Mndewa. Mulamseni mbwigaangu Pesisi, ayo yasang'hanike ng'hani sama ya Mndewa. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Mulamseni Lufo, yasaguligwe na Mndewa, mulamseni na mamaake, ayo vivija yakalile kamba mamaangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Mulamseni Asinikilito, Filegoni, Helime, Patuloba, Helima, na ndugu wamtogole Kilisto wali hamoja nao. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Mulamseni Filologo, Yulia, Nelea na lumbu jake, na Olimpa, na wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto wali hamoja nao.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Ilamseni wenyego kwa wenyego na mnonelo ung'alile. Madale gose ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisto gowalamsa.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Ndugu zangu, nowayalalila kamba mwitiganye na awo wogala mbagu na ving'hwaso mzinzila zenu, mkugahindula mafundizo gamfundizigwe. Mwinege nawo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Kwavija wanhu kamba hiwo hawamsang'hanikila Mndewa wetu Kilisto, ila wosang'hanikila gaja gowosulukila wenyego. Muulonzi unyilibuke na mbuli za kunogeza, woivwizila mioyo ya wanhu wali na ngelegeza ndodo. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Kila munhu kahulika mmbuli ya wende umulinao, avo nodeng'ha sama yenu. Nolonda muwe na nzewele mmbuli ya gaja ganogile, ila muwe wabozi mmbuli ya gaja gehile. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Mulungu wa tindiwalo mbwisa komuhonda Mwenembago hasi ha magulu genu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Ngekewa ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto iwe hamoja na mweye.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Timoteo, msang'hana miyangu, kowalamsa, na Lukio, na Yasoni, na Sosipata, Wayahudi wayangu.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Nie Tatio, nyandike lupwilili luno, nowalamsa mditwaga da Mndewa.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Gayo, mwenekae wangu na wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto, kowalamsa. Elasto, mwika hela wa idiwambo, na ndugu yetu Kwato wowalamsa. <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Ngekewa ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto iwe hamoja na mweye mose. Amina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyandiko ziyagwe za umwaka zabule mnhongo wa 24.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhambiko ya Kimambukizo ya Kumuyenzi Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Yenzi yose imcholele Mulungu yali na udaho wa kuwagela mweye mhiko kubitila Usenga wangu Unogile na kumpeta Yesu Kilisto na kubitila lugubulo lwa nyong'onyo ifisigwe songela mwaka. <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Ila sambi igubuligwa kubitila Nyandiko Zing'alile za wahokozi na kubitila ndagizi ya Mulungu wa digunge itendigwa itangigwe na Wamhazi wose, giladi wanhu wose wamtogole na kumtegeleza heyo.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Ha Mulungu, yeiyeka yali na nzewele, yayenzigwe milongo yose kubitila Yesu Kilisto! Amina.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
